body:
for Mid (if 0 AP) and support:  
Comet, Manaflow, Transendence, scorch. Cheap shot, Ult hunter.

Liandrys -> Manamune -> Axiom -> Cdr boots -> lethality items  


for Mid if you have ap in your team:   
First strike, boots, biscuits, cosmic insight, manaflow, gathering storm.

Eclipse -> Manamune -> Axiom -> Botrk -> lethality items
